-------------Docker Compose --------------------

* To automate the process of creating the multiple container we will use the docker compose 
* Docker compose is a tool that allows you to define and run the multi-container based application 
* Here we write the YAML file for the docker compose deployment
Name : docker-compose.yml or docker-compose.yaml 
YAML -Yet another Markup language 
We can create/start/stop/restart/delete all the container at a time 
Docker compose will work on single Host

